      ],
      "text": "The plugin exposes agent-facing tools including agent_launch, agent_respond, agent_output, agent_sessions, agent_kill, agent_stats, agent_merge, agent_pr, agent_worktree_status, agent_worktree_cleanup, and four agent_goal_* tools."
    },
