      ],
      "text": "Chat commands mirror common workflows: /agent, /agent_sessions, /agent_output, /agent_respond, /agent_kill, /agent_stats, /agent_policy, /agent_goal, /agent_goal_status, /agent_goal_edit, and /agent_goal_stop."
