        "slc_6d8ec0518fc11f94d069b05c0c804dade682843e0127d1bba235fcb449e978b0"
      ],
      "text": "In ask-mode worktree decisions, buttons adapt to state: new branches offer Merge/Open PR/Later/Discard, existing-PR branches add View PR and Sync PR, and PR options are omitted when the GitHub CLI is unavailable."
    },
